# ============================================================
# Important:
# Keep source code, README.md, requirements.txt,
# buildozer.spec, database schema/migrations,
# tests, and application assets under version control.
#
# Never commit real customer records, transaction databases,
# passwords, or Android signing keys.
# ============================================================
